 Yelp, Google, and the Better Business Bureau are great resources.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Verify Credentials:<\/strong> Make sure the contractor is licensed, insured, and bonded. This not only protects you from liability but also ensures that the contractor meets the necessary industry standards.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Request Detailed Estimates:<\/strong> Get detailed estimates from multiple contractors. This will give you a better understanding of the costs involved and help you make an informed decision.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Check Past Work:<\/strong> Ask for references and examples of past projects. This will give you a sense of their craftsmanship and attention to detail.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Clear Communication:<\/strong> Ensure the contractor is communicative and transparent throughout the process. A good contractor will keep you informed and address any concerns promptly.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Now that you&#8217;re equipped with these tips, let&#8217;s dive into our list of the top 5 general contractors in Portland.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Top 5 General Contractors in Portland:<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/unnamed.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10875\" style=\"width:229px;height:auto\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Neil Kelly Portland \u2013 (503) 288-7461 \u2013<strong> <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.neilkelly.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">&nbsp;https:\/\/www.neilkelly.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>4.6 stars \u2013 183 Google reviews<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Located: <\/strong>804 N Alberta St, Portland, OR 97217<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Specializes in: <\/strong>Residential<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-al